# Installed packages, never source. 2,463 of these were tracked until
# 2026-08-15: every `git status` walked them and timed out at 40s, and -- the
# expensive part -- `git status --short` returned an EMPTY view while five files
# sat staged, which was very nearly reported as a clean tree. The `git add -A`
# ban documented in .gitattributes was treating that symptom; this is the cause.
node_modules/
